From 533a33802bab516d005700dee6baf2e3fe37a1fc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Paul Junod <donujp@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 22:31:52 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] displayid2: parse display interface features

Decode revision-zero interface features into an owned low-level API.
Require the fixed payload and exact bounded additional-pair count before
reading fields. Diagnose reserved encodings while retaining known fields
and raw additional enum values without turning them into capabilities.

Add typed access and readable decoder output, with direct C regressions
for counts, malformed blocks, reserved values and recovery.
